import assets.dl

to get [a Farm art pose at] {an array:position} [sized] {an array:scale} [turned] {an array:rotation}:
    return a UI scene pose at (a UI scene vector from position) rotated (a UI scene vector from rotation) scaled (a UI scene vector from scale)

to get [a Farm art group named] {a value:name} [at] {an array:position} [sized] {an array:scale} [turned] {an array:rotation} [under] {integer:parent} [in] {a pointer to a list:parts}:
    set index to the length of parts
    append (a UI scene group named name under parent at (a Farm art pose at position sized scale turned rotation)) to parts
    return index

to get [a Farm art group named] {a value:name} [at] {an array:position} [under] {integer:parent} [in] {a pointer to a list:parts}:
    return a Farm art group named name at position sized [1.0,1.0,1.0] turned [0.0,0.0,0.0] under parent in parts

to get [a Farm art material colored] {an array:channels} [roughness] {floating-point number:roughness} [metalness] {floating-point number:metalness}:
    require condition ((the length of channels) = 3) reporting "Farm material colors require three channels"
    set color to UI ink (the item at 0 in channels) (the item at 1 in channels) (the item at 2 in channels)
    return a UI scene material with color color roughness roughness metalness metalness

to get [a Farm art material colored] {an array:channels}:
    return a Farm art material colored channels roughness 0.82 metalness 0.0

to [add Farm piece named] {a value:name} [using] {a value:shape} [colored] {UI scene material:material} [at] {an array:position} [sized] {an array:scale} [turned] {an array:rotation} [under] {integer:parent} [to] {a pointer to a list:parts} [with] {a pointer to website farm art library:library}:
    set mesh to the Farm shape named shape in library
    set pose to a Farm art pose at position sized scale turned rotation
    append (a UI scene mesh part named name under parent using mesh with material material at pose) to parts

to [add Farm] {a value:shape} [colored] {UI scene material:material} [at] {an array:position} [sized] {an array:scale} [turned] {an array:rotation} [under] {integer:parent} [to] {a pointer to a list:parts} [with] {a pointer to website farm art library:library}:
    add Farm piece named "" using shape colored material at position sized scale turned rotation under parent to parts with library

to [add Farm] {a value:shape} [colored] {UI scene material:material} [at] {an array:position} [sized] {an array:scale} [under] {integer:parent} [to] {a pointer to a list:parts} [with] {a pointer to website farm art library:library}:
    add Farm shape colored material at position sized scale turned [0.0,0.0,0.0] under parent to parts with library

to [add Farm] {a value:shape} [colored] {an array:channels} [at] {an array:position} [sized] {an array:scale} [turned] {an array:rotation} [under] {integer:parent} [to] {a pointer to a list:parts} [with] {a pointer to website farm art library:library}:
    add Farm shape colored (a Farm art material colored channels) at position sized scale turned rotation under parent to parts with library

to [add Farm] {a value:shape} [colored] {an array:channels} [at] {an array:position} [sized] {an array:scale} [under] {integer:parent} [to] {a pointer to a list:parts} [with] {a pointer to website farm art library:library}:
    add Farm shape colored channels at position sized scale turned [0.0,0.0,0.0] under parent to parts with library

to get [a completed Farm model from] {a pointer to a list:parts}:
    set model to a UI scene model taking parts parts
    free parts
    return model
